{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e2e-full-klonix-001",
    "name": "E2E — Full flow (Klonixpharback)",
    "description": "## Docs (read first)\\n- **Frontend integration:** `docs/FRONTEND_INTEGRATION.md`\\n- **AI prompt for UI work:** `docs/FRONTEND_AI_PROMPT.md`\\n- **This collection:** `postman/E2E_POSTMAN_README.md`\\n\\n## Errors (typical JSON)\\n`{ \\\"message\\\": string, \\\"errorCode\\\": string, \\\"details\\\"?: unknown }` — branch UI on **errorCode** (e.g. `VALIDATION_ERROR`, `AUTH_INVALID_CREDENTIALS`, `MUST_CHANGE_PASSWORD`, `USER_EMPLOYEE_ID_EXISTS`).\\n\\n## Auth quick reference\\n- **Tenant login:** `POST /api/auth/login` body `{ \\\"organization\\\", \\\"employeeId\\\", \\\"password\\\" }` → `{ token, role, name, employeeId, email?, companyName, mustChangePassword }`.\\n- **Platform login:** `POST /api/platform/login` `{ \\\"identifier\\\", \\\"password\\\" }` → `{ token, role: PLATFORM_ADMIN, name }`.\\n- **Protected calls:** header `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.\\n\\n## Onboarding\\n- **Super admin (1.2):** invite link + `POST /api/auth/set-password` (token in URL/body).\\n- **Other users (4.2 / 4.0):** no email required; `temporaryPassword` in response; after login call `POST /api/auth/change-password` if `mustChangePassword` is true.\\n\\n## Variables\\nSet **baseUrl**. **1.2** prerequest fills `e2ePrefix` + `e2eAdminEmail` only when both are blank. See README for full variable table.\\n\\nRun folders **0→9** in order for full E2E.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
